        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:001",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "为什么堂哥天天打游戏二伯也不管？",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-08-02-taking-responsibility-for-your-own-life_dialogue_001_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "001",
          "speaker": "儿子"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:002",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "都长大了，都高考结束了，考上大学了。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-08-02-taking-responsibility-for-your-own-life_dialogue_002_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "002",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:003",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "自己都能对自己负责了。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-08-02-taking-responsibility-for-your-own-life_dialogue_003_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "003",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:004",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "所以说你自己的生活你自己搞了，知道吗？",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-08-02-taking-responsibility-for-your-own-life_dialogue_004_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "004",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:005",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "以后你也这样。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-08-02-taking-responsibility-for-your-own-life_dialogue_005_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "005",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:006",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "真的吗？",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-08-02-taking-responsibility-for-your-own-life_dialogue_006_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
